OL,3,GNEWSASeptember 11 watch party
OL,4,Acriticised
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planned "Watch Party" reshowing news
OL,7,Ffootage of the attacks of 11 September
OL,8,F2001 has been criticised as "crossing a
OL,9,Fline".
OL,11,FThe event, staged by political arts
OL,12,Fgroup Verdurin, is due to re-run
OL,13,Ftelevision broadcasts attacks of the on
OL,14,FNew York Trade Center in real time at
OL,15,Fthe Wild Boscombe Cafe in Bournemouth
OL,16,Fafter the 25th anniversary later this
OL,17,Fweek.
OL,19,FBournemouth Christchurch and Poole
OL,20,F(BCP) councillor Simon McCormack
OL,21,Fcriticised the event and said it "risks
OL,22,Fturning tragedy into spectacle".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
